<title>USA: Firm holds 5.78 pct SCP Pool stake.</title>
<headline>Firm holds 5.78 pct SCP Pool stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wynnefield Partners Small Cap Value L.P., a New York investment firm, said Monday it holds a 5.78 percent stake or 244,200 common shares in SCP Pool Corp, of Covington, La.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Wynnefield said it bought the stake for $4.1 million and holds it for investment.</p>
</text>
